    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89623" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσκοινωνέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be partaker</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i>of</i> a thing, <i>share in</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				252a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν δρωμένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					66.12
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάσεών τινι</span>
