				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				757d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				364.27
			</span></i> (Ephesus, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>give</i> one <i>a share of . . </i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. σφίσι τῶν παρόντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					37.56
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τούτῳ ἀπὸ τῶν ὑμετέρων
				χρημάτων</span> D <i><span class="en">
				34.36
			</span></i>.</div>
